    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "Joe Biden is framed positively as proposing a corrective national response to COVID-19—phrases like \"outlined a range of proposals for crafting a better national response\" and experts being \"encouraged by Biden's plan\" position him as a figure working to protect public safety and restore normalcy (Guardian/Virtuous role)."
  },
  "Altruistic_Catalysts": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "The text does not depict rebels, martyrs, or underdogs challenging the status quo or sacrificing for change; it focuses on policy proposals and expert reactions rather than insurgent or sacrificial narratives."
