    "explanation": "There is no portrayal of actors initiating conflict, using force, or engaging in hostile behaviour; the narrative centers on containment and information provision."
  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "The text contains no suggestions of secrecy, betrayal, manipulation, misinformation, or covert undermining; it emphasizes transparent public health outreach."
  },
  "Institutional_Toxins": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "There is no depiction of corruption or incompetence; the institution (call centre) is presented as functional and effective (46,000 calls in ~10 days)."
  },
  "Marginalized_Sufferers": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "Although the context is an epidemic, the text does not frame any group as passive victims, exploited, forgotten, or scapegoated; it highlights active support and information services instead."
