  "Deceptive_Subversives": {{
    "is_used": "Yes or No",
    "explanation": "If Yes, provide evidence of how a participant is framed through secrecy, betrayal, or misinformation (e.g., Conspirator, Spy, Traitor, Deceiver, Saboteur, Foreign Adversary)."
